stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING
    PENDING --> RUNNING: 调度且未停止
    PENDING --> STOPPED: 管理员取消
    RUNNING --> SUCCESS: 全范围提交及校验完成
    RUNNING --> FAILED: 异常或超时
    RUNNING --> STOPPED: 停止请求已确认
    FAILED --> RETRYING: 可恢复且预算未耗尽
    FAILED --> STOPPED: 管理员明确放弃
    FAILED --> FAILED: 耗尽或不可恢复，保留原因
    RETRYING --> RUNNING: 等待结束且未停止
    RETRYING --> STOPPED: 管理员取消
    SUCCESS --> [*]
    STOPPED --> [*]
